flowchart LR
    U[Sales or service user\nchat, email, voice transcript] --> GW[OCI API Gateway]
    GW --> SUP[CRM Supervisor Agent\nOCI Function]
    SUP -. plan request .-> GAI[OCI Generative AI\nintent and entity extraction]
    SUP --> RULES[Rule-based NLU fallback]
    SUP --> PLAN{Dependency-aware\naction plan}

    PLAN --> LEAD[Lead Creation Agent\nOCI Function]
    LEAD -- lead_id, score --> OPP[Opportunity Creation Agent\nOCI Function]
    OPP -- opportunity_id --> QUOTE[Quote Generation Agent\nOCI Function]
    PLAN --> CASE[Case Creation Agent\nOCI Function]

    LEAD --> CRM[(CRM REST API)]
    OPP --> CRM
    QUOTE --> CRM
    CASE --> CRM

    VAULT[OCI Vault\nCRM API secret] -.-> LEAD
    VAULT -.-> OPP
    VAULT -.-> QUOTE
    VAULT -.-> CASE

    QUOTE -- discount above limit --> REVIEW[Human approval queue]
    SUP -- low confidence --> REVIEW
    SUP --> RESP[Consolidated response\nrecord IDs, review items, audit trail]
    SUP --> LOG[OCI Logging]
